    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Cobra",
    "summary": "This works in your Shooting phase, in two steps:\n\n- right after this model's D-impaler is given a target, roll a D6 for that target and for every unit within 3\" of it, and a unit whose roll is 5+ is struck by a D-rift\n- once this model has finished attacking that target, every unit that a D-rift struck this phase takes D3 **mortal wounds**",
